3 LONG TITLE
4 General Description:
5 This bill amends provisions related to local referendums.
6 Highlighted Provisions:
7 This bill:
8 ▸ defines terms;
9 ▸ subject to certain exceptions, establishes a process for voters who are residents of a school
district to hold a referendum on a law passed by the school district's local school board, including a law
that increases a tax or imposes a new tax; and
1 2 ▸ makes technical and conforming changes.
